  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;Innovate her: Fuelling Women&apos;s Success in STEM&quot;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&amp;quot;InnovateHER: Fuelling Women&amp;#39;s Success in STEM&amp;quot; aims to support Azerbaijani female students in STEM fields through forums, seminars, and a mentorship program, in total 8 months long. The project involves Azerbaijani alumni from STEM fields as mentors for university students aspiring to study abroad or pursue STEM careers. Participants will be selected through applications and interviews. Mentors will choose mentees based on interviews and shared interests. The mentorship includes monthly meetings and training. Part of the project will be field trips to STEM-related workplaces. The project seeks to empower women in STEM and address gender inequality in the field.</narrative>
  </description>
